###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C16070
obo:NCIT_C16070 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                rdfs:subClassOf obo:NCIT_C15790 ;
                obo:IAO_0000115 "A phase III, randomized, placebo-controlled cancer prevention trial of >18,000 men coordinated by the Southwest Oncology Group.  The trial will determine the effect of a daily dose of finasteride taken for seven years on the biopsy-proven prevalence of prostate cancer.  It is scheduled to be completed in 2004." ;
