   owl:annotatedTarget "Any physical or virtual contact between a patient (or trial subject) and healthcare provider at which an assessment or activity takes place. (from NCIt: Clinical Encounter, Code C142427)  EXAMPLE(S):    A physician visits a patient in a hospital ward to assess his condition. A study subject comes into the hospital for a routine test for the clinical trial she is on. A research nurse calls the parent of a child on a clinical trial to see if any side effects are occurring.  OTHER NAME(S): Encounter Visit  NOTE(S):" ;
   obo:NCIT_P378 "BRIDG 5.3"
 ] .

