###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C221397
obo:NCIT_C221397 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                 rdfs:subClassOf obo:NCIT_C215504 ;
                 obo:IAO_0000115 "A design that allows for analysis of an observational study in a manner that would align with posing the same study question in a randomized clinical trial. This would minimize challenges in determining treatment effectiveness, which is often encountered in observational studies." ;
