:NV_C0086 rdf:type owl:Class ;
          rdfs:subClassOf :NV_C0085 ;
          rdfs:comment """Milestone dates exist at study level (level 1), country level (level 2) and site level (level 3). If applicable, milestone may be rolled-up from lower levels to higher levels based on a maximum or minimum logic.
E.g. FPFV (First Patient First Visit) actual date at country level is the minimum of all FPFV actual dates at site level for all sites located in the country."""@en ;
          rdfs:label "Milestone Roll-up"@en .


